{"id":"n79176-1-6","stage":3,"title":"체하다 · 积食","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79176-1-6-1","ko":"배가 아프고 속이 더부룩해서 죽겠어요.","zh":"肚子疼，胃也胀得难受死了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배가","meaning":"肚子","explanation":"배：肚子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"3","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아프고","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속이","meaning":"内脏，心口，肚子","explanation":"속：内脏，心口，肚子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"3","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더부룩해서","meaning":"胃胀","explanation":"더부룩하다：胃胀；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"더부룩하다","audio":"/audio/72a9a25f5b4daae82528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47389","senseId":"1","lemma":"더부룩하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"죽겠어요.","meaning":"表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。","explanation":"죽다：表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죽다","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77246","senseId":"1","lemma":"죽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"肚子","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"女性的身体中怀孩子的部分。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"内脏，心口，肚子","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryId":"71278","definition":"人的身体中，腹部的内部或肠胃。","pronunciation":["속ː"]},{"id":"72a9a25f5b4daae8","term":"더부룩하다","zh":"胃胀","audio":"/audio/72a9a25f5b4daae82528.mp3","entryId":"47389","definition":"消化不良，肚子不舒服。","pronunciation":["더부루카다"]},{"id":"66bd3b1f27c0ee2e","term":"죽다","zh":"表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3","entryId":"77246","definition":"表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。","pronunciation":["죽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ad72a65c73d857b469a2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79176-1-6-2","ko":"밥을 급하게 먹더니 결국 체했구나.","zh":"你吃饭那么急，结果还是积食了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"급하게","meaning":"急忙，急切，急促","explanation":"급하다：急忙，急切，急促；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"급하다","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86862","senseId":"2","lemma":"급하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹더니","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결국","meaning":"最后，终于","explanation":"결국：最后，终于","readings":[{"term":"결국","audio":"/audio/a1a5375588e265b035a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17260","senseId":"1","lemma":"결국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"체했구나.","meaning":"积食，滞食，伤食","explanation":"체하다：积食，滞食，伤食；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"체하다","audio":"/audio/bd93c4a8e1a8fffbeb82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79176","senseId":"1","lemma":"체하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"5c52cd24e00b6dba","term":"급하다","zh":"急忙，急切，急促","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3","entryId":"86862","definition":"做事匆促，没有闲暇。","pronunciation":["그파다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"a1a5375588e265b0","term":"결국","zh":"最后，终于","audio":"/audio/a1a5375588e265b035a5.mp3","entryId":"17260","definition":"作为事情的结果。","pronunciation":["결국"]},{"id":"bd93c4a8e1a8fffb","term":"체하다","zh":"积食，滞食，伤食","audio":"/audio/bd93c4a8e1a8fffbeb82.mp3","entryId":"79176","definition":"吃的食物不好消化，堵在肚子里。","pronunciation":["체하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9d5d2e07b37787e617bb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.12,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79176","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":106,"sequenceScore":2.7734,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你吃饭那么急，结果还是积食了。","肚子疼，胃也胀得难受死了。","你为什么那样紧紧握着手机啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["肚子疼，胃也胀得难受死了。","你为什么那样紧紧握着手机啊？","你吃饭那么急，结果还是积食了。"],"answer":2}]}
